.03829864,0.03088554,0.05789565,-0.0462302,0.02613204,-0.09982424,0.02496091,-0.005202,0.158673,-0.03307529,0.07164242,0.01612838,-0.0216143,-0.03398797,0.01942495,-0.04760098,-0.02477375,-0.01142022,0.12161689,0.02852381,0.02334166,0.02854688,-0.01395167,-0.00719118,-0.02595256,-0.04344341,0.00161253,-0.02435667,0.02755532,-0.04859103,0.07433476,0.08477749,-0.0263484,-0.06634326,-0.01918433,0.01857045,-0.00535781,0.00246142,0.00283635,-0.03568778,0.03405746,-0.02393762,0.04100803,-0.00827028,0.02007185,-0.03035711,0.01108298,0.02137132,-0.00677321,0.07344617,-0.05569443],"last_embed":{"hash":"uad9vt","tokens":426}}},"last_read":{"hash":"uad9vt","at":1774939551699},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1774939523640,"size":4814,"at":1774939536741,"hash":"uad9vt"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#Assessing ChatGPT’s Competency in Addressing Interdisciplinary Inquiries on Chatbot Uses in Sports Rehabilitation: Simulation Study":[20,42],"#Assessing ChatGPT’s Competency in Addressing Interdisciplinary Inquiries on Chatbot Uses in Sports Rehabilitation: Simulation Study#{1}":[21,25],"#Assessing ChatGPT’s Competency in Addressing Interdisciplinary Inquiries on Chatbot Uses in Sports Rehabilitation: Simulation Study#📝 Benim Notlarım":[26,28],"#Assessing ChatGPT’s Competency in Addressing Interdisciplinary Inquiries on Chatbot Uses in Sports Rehabilitation: Simulation Study#🟡 Genel Bilgiler (Sarı)":[29,31],"#Assessing ChatGPT’s Competency in Addressing Interdisciplinary Inquiries on Chatbot Uses in Sports Rehabilitation: Simulation Study#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)":[32,34],"#Assessing ChatGPT’s Competency in Addressing Interdisciplinary Inquiries on Chatbot Uses in Sports Rehabilitation: Simulation Study#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[33,34],"#Assessing ChatGPT’s Competency in Addressing Interdisciplinary Inquiries on Chatbot Uses in Sports Rehabilitation: Simulation Study#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[35,37],"#Assessing ChatGPT’s Competency in Addressing Interdisciplinary Inquiries on Chatbot Uses in Sports Rehabilitation: Simulation Study#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[36,37],"#Assessing ChatGPT’s Competency in Addressing Interdisciplinary Inquiries on Chatbot Uses in Sports Rehabilitation: Simulation Study#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#Assessing ChatGPT’s Competency in Addressing Interdisciplinary Inquiries on Chatbot Uses in Sports Rehabilitation: Simulation Study#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42],"#Assessing ChatGPT’s Competency in Addressing Interdisciplinary Inquiries on Chatbot Uses in Sports Rehabilitation: Simulation Study#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)#{1}":[42,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/64ES368L","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/JQ7BHR8N?page=1&annotation=JD7GM5DG","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/JQ7BHR8N?page=1&annotation=7KSQ6K4R","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 5","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/JQ7BHR8N?page=5&annotation=HM99J7I6","line":42}],"metadata":{"Title":"Assessing ChatGPT’s Competency in Addressing Interdisciplinary Inquiries on Chatbot Uses in Sports Rehabilitation: Simulation Study","Authors":"Joseph C McBee, Daniel Y Han, Li Liu, Leah Ma, Donald A Adjeroh, Dong Xu, Gangqing Hu","Year":2024,"DOI":"10.2196/51157","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"We developed a model termed PanelGPT to assess ChatGPT’s competency in addressing interdisciplinary topics through simulated panel discussions. Taking chatbot uses in sports rehabilitation as an example of an interdisciplinary topic, we prompted ChatGPT through PanelGPT to role-play a physiotherapist, psychologist, nutritionist, artificial intelligence expert, and athlete in a simulated panel discussion.","Findings":"By tackling questions related to chatbot uses in sports rehabilitation with respect to patient education, physiotherapy, physiology, nutrition, and ethical considerations, responses from the ChatGPT-simulated panel discussion reasonably pointed to various benefits such as 24/7 support, personalized advice, automated tracking, and reminders. ChatGPT also correctly emphasized the importance of patient education, and identified challenges such as limited interaction modes, inaccuracies in emotion-related advice, assurance of data privacy and security, transparency in data handling, and fairness in model training. It also stressed that chatbots are to assist as a copilot, not to replace human health care professionals in the rehabilitation process.","Conclusions":"","Limitations":"It could be that the dataset used to train ChatGPT for the nutritionist was underrepresented in the rehabilitation field. Indeed, a combined search for “rehabilitation” (or “rehab”) and “nutritionist” (or “nutrition”) on PubMed yielded 6-8 times fewer hits compared to searches involving the terms “physiotherapist” (or “physiotherapy”) or “psychologist” (or “psychology”) (as of July 7, 2023). To address this limitation, the human operator could send reminders to the nutritionist to elicit a response. In contrast to the nutritionist, the AI expert responded to questions on all topics.","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"uad9vt","at":1774939551561}},"smart_blocks:Augmented Dietitian Okunmuşlar/mcbeeAssessingChatGPTsCompetency2024b.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.02636597,0.05020776,0.02140679,-0.01652467,-0.02484984,0.04561385,0.04527199,0.08271621,0.01745353,-0.01079997,-0.01367603,-0.11007919,0.00206208,0.06931841,0.06597097,0.00772431,0.0034825,0.05603166,0.0248779,0.02159424,0.02418091,-0.04999389,0.02876918,0.0027924,0.03354475,-0.02054558,-0.03744448,-0.06064468,-0.07007957,-0.19726393,0.02267453,0.01382728,0.06785195,-0.00488354,-0.09541646,0.05404784,-0.04641643,0.03983382,-0.03722874,0